      "rationale": "The competency names two language forms, \"5 groups of 3\" and \"5 threes\"; the \"groups of\" form appears in 14 of the 15 samples, such as seed 42's \"There are 4 groups of 3\", but the plural number-word form \"5 threes\" never appears anywhere in any sample, so one of the two explicitly named phrasings is entirely unrepresented."
    },
